# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# setup: applink
# A program's window moves by its tab like any other: TikuBasic's Project
# window dragged to a new place is there.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 4
menu-pick Development
wait 4
expect-menu TikuBasic
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
expect-title Project
drag-window Project 400 300
wait 8
expect-window-at 370 290
note what is on screen is what a full redraw would paint: the window
note left no stale copy behind and is drawn where it now is
expect-same-as-redraw
quit
